04:03.640 --> 04:06.440
Are you saying you don't trust me?

04:06.440 --> 04:09.810
But why now?

04:12.550 --> 04:14.580
To teach us a lesson!

04:14.580 --> 04:19.450
To get back at the people who
stole his father's research!

04:19.450 --> 04:23.420
Don't talk like that now!
We're all in the same boat here!

04:23.420 --> 04:30.190
