just sitting around!

08:33.570 --> 08:36.440
What, did something happen?

08:36.440 --> 08:38.910
No, no! Nothing at all!

08:40.580 --> 08:42.210
Okay then.

08:45.490 --> 08:47.320
By the way...

08:47.860 --> 08:50.890
I keep thinking about something
Usami said before he died.

08:50.890 --> 08:52.590
What's that?

08:52.590 --> 08:54.720
Tatsuo Kagura is alive.

09:03.600 --> 09:05.370
What the heck?

09:10.850 --> 09:11.910
It's him!

09:11.910 --> 09:13.540
Huh?

09:18.850 --> 09:21.460
Geez! What's wrong with you?!

09:21.460 --> 09:23.390
It's him! The friggin' Skull Man!

09:23.390 --> 09:25.020
What?

09:26.260 --> 09:28.360
It's me, Kusaka!

09:28.360 --> 09:31.170
