10:50.780 --> 10:53.370
You bastard!

11:04.130 --> 11:09.760
You murderer! Let's see who you really are!

11:27.110 --> 11:28.740
Hayato!

11:48.740 --> 11:50.360
Hayato!

12:35.650 --> 12:37.350
