12:38.020 --> 12:39.890
Are you okay, Hayato?

12:39.890 --> 12:42.860
Yeah, it just grazed me.

12:51.800 --> 12:53.820
You're late, idiots.

12:55.840 --> 13:02.040
We've confirmed the victim's identity:
Otomo City Major Takemi Kusaka, age 52.

13:02.380 --> 13:03.940
He's suffered grave wounds to...

13:03.940 --> 13:09.050
