13:43.450 --> 13:45.440
Mr. Kuroshio!

13:45.790 --> 13:47.090
Not again!

13:47.090 --> 13:50.720
Just get them to a hospital, quick.

13:56.230 --> 13:57.630
Damn it!

13:57.630 --> 13:57.900
Terror in Broad Daylight!
Mayor Assassinated!
Damn it!

13:57.900 --> 13:59.370
